,{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"A Pokémon that was formed by 108 spirits. It is bound to a fissure in an odd keystone."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"１０８個の 魂が 集まって 生まれた ポケモン。 要石の ひび割れに つながれている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il fut emprisonné dans la fissure d’une clé de voûte étrange en guise de punition il y a 500 ans."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Como castigo por una fechoría 500 años atrás, está unido a la fisura de una piedra angular mística."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It was bound to a fissure in an odd keystone as punishment for misdeeds 500 years ago."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"５００年前に 悪さをしたため 要石の ひび割れに 体を つなぎとめられてしまった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Un Pokémon composé de 108 esprits. Il provient d’une fissure dans une clé de voûte étrange."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Se formó a partir de 108 espíritus. Está unido a la fisura de una piedra angular mística."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"A Pokémon that was formed by 108 spirits. It is bound to a fissure in an odd keystone."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"１０８個の 魂が 集まって 生まれた ポケモン。 要石の ひび割れに つながれている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il fut emprisonné dans la fissure d’une clé de voûte étrange en guise de punition il y a 500 ans."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Como castigo por una fechoría 500 años atrás, está unido a la fisura de una piedra angular mística."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It was bound to a fissure in an odd keystone as punishment for misdeeds 500 years ago."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"５００年前に 悪さをしたため 要石の ひび割れに 体を つなぎとめられてしまった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ce Pokémon est né de la fusion de 108 âmes, mais on raconte que certaines d’entre elles seraient de nature maléfique."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Este Pokémon se formó a partir de